  <data name="GuideIndexing" xml:space="preserve"><value>In Settings, choose sequential, parallel or automatic indexing. Parallel mode handles up to two different sources that need new indexes. A single source uses one worker. Existing indexes are verified before reuse.</value></data>
  <data name="GuideTimeZone" xml:space="preserve"><value>Choose the display time zone under Analysis options in Settings. Check the column heading when comparing timestamps. Changing the zone displays the same instant in the newly selected time zone.</value></data>
